    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/51eea706-dc67-4cbf-b77f-4d39d8e1e1c7-image.png\" style=\"width: 224px; height: 207px;\" /></p><p>Object is projected as shown so as per motion under gravity,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p><p>Object takes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> to fall on ground height of balloon from ground,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ut</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
